    "body": "A fact for this issue from #547 (PR #1156): electrode generation from picked cavity faces ships as the undoable command `ElectrodeFromFaces` and the MCP tool `electrode_from_faces`, with no GUI entry. The sinker pages here are where its button belongs: pick the floor and walls, state undersize (or a condition), stub and pickup, run the command; its answer (`ElectrodeBox`) carries the burn point, cavity X / Y, floor and top Z that seed the Sinker Burn.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
